Comfort-Media (8 panels):
  P1  Seat Heaters                 → 5 subqueries for latest value_num per seat heater signal
  P2  Climate Details              → hvac_auto_mode/hvac_ac_enabled NOT in signal mapping → NULL; HvacSteeringWheelHeatLevel retained
