Aggregation strategy:
  - Numeric signals: MAX(value_num) FILTER (WHERE signal_name = '...') — correct for per-ts pivot
  - Text signals:    MAX(value_text) FILTER (WHERE signal_name = '...') — safe within GROUP BY ts (1 row per signal)
  - Bool signals:    bool_or(value_bool) FILTER (WHERE signal_name = '...') — safe within GROUP BY ts
  - Latest text:     Used in comfort-media P2 via subquery ORDER BY ts DESC LIMIT 1
  - HvacPower:       DISABLED in P2 (climate) and P7 (climate) — enum, not numeric

Performance:
  - All queries use ts BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo()
  - All queries use signal_name IN (...) or signal_name = '...'

